# A Room that leaves the battlefield and returns is a new object (CR 400.7), and it did not enter as a spell, so it enters
# with neither door unlocked (CR 709.5d): Bot1's Flickerwisp exiles its Unholy Annex (cast as the left door, Black Lotus
# paying), and it returns at the beginning of the end step with no name, no abilities and no mana value to speak of - Annex
# had been exiled, so its end step ability did not trigger that turn, and the returned Room does not draw either.
# Locked doors are unlocked for their mana cost (CR 709.5e): on turn 3 the nameless Room's right door is, and "when you
# unlock this door" triggers for the new object, giving the 6/6 Demon the first Room, which had only the left door, never made.
# Two Mox Pearls and a Mox Jet pay for Flickerwisp's {1}{W}{W} on turn 1; two Swamps and the Jet pay Ritual Chamber's
# {3}{B}{B} with the Pearls' generic mana on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Flickerwisp
Swamp
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber.Cast(Ability: Unholy Annex)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flickerwisp.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Unholy Annex)
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Exile = Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Bot1.Battlefield..Doors.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield..ManaValue = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield..Types = Enchantment
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.#1.Activate(Ability: right door)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ritual Chamber.Doors = Ritual Chamber
Bot1.Battlefield.Ritual Chamber.ManaValue = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Demon Token.Power = 6
Bot1.Life = 20
